('127.266.d.1.A',3,'A stadium''s ticket office, concession stand, and grounds crew are examples of:','["Business activities that support a sports organization", "Rival teams", "Government agencies", "Fan clubs"]'::jsonb,0,'Production, marketing, and management work together.','original'),
