('127.266.d.4.C',3,'A theater earned $90,000 in revenue and spent $100,000. It had a:','["Profit of $90,000", "Loss of $100,000", "Profit of $10,000", "Loss of $10,000"]'::jsonb,3,'Revenue minus expenses.','original'),
